invariant operation sumFive "All five params are i64."
label startSumFive
call sumAbCall math.addI64
argument sumAbCall left I64 a
argument sumAbCall right I64 b
run sumAbCall
bind value sumAb CSignedInt64 sumAbCall
call sumAbcCall math.addI64
argument sumAbcCall left I64 sumAb
argument sumAbcCall right I64 c
run sumAbcCall
bind value sumAbc CSignedInt64 sumAbcCall
