argument sumAbcdCall left I64 sumAbc
argument sumAbcdCall right I64 d
run sumAbcdCall
bind value sumAbcd CSignedInt64 sumAbcdCall
call sumAbcdeCall math.addI64
argument sumAbcdeCall left I64 sumAbcd
argument sumAbcdeCall right I64 e
run sumAbcdeCall
bind value total CSignedInt64 sumAbcdeCall
return ok total

operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
